  },
  {
   "slot": "S2",
   "text": "This is The Young Martyr, painted by Paul Delaroche in 1855.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 2
  },
  {
   "slot": "S3",
   "text": "A girl floats on the river with a halo above her, while two figures watch from the shore.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": 8,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "girl",
     "to": "martyr"
    },
    {
     "on": "halo",
     "to": "halo"
    },
    {
     "on": "figures",
     "to": "parents"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S4",
   "text": "But look at her wrists.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "wrists",
     "to": "hands_rope"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S5",
   "text": "Rope ties her hands together.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 15,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "Rope",
     "to": "hands_rope"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S6",
   "text": "She doesn't swim.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "swim",
     "to": "martyr"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S6",
   "text": "She doesn't struggle.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "struggle",
     "to": "hands_rope"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S6",
   "text": "She simply floats.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 15,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "floats",
     "to": "martyr"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S7",
   "text": "According to Roman law under Diocletian, Christians who would not honour the gods faced prison or death.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 24
  },
  {
   "slot": "S8",
   "text": "Her faith should have kept her safe.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "faith",
     "to": "halo"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S9",
   "text": "But she was thrown into the Tiber instead.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 20,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "Tiber",
     "to": "water"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S10",
   "text": "And here's the unsettling part.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "S11",
   "text": "Her face looks peacefully asleep, yet her body lies stiff as death.",
